      "t": "Настя, ты только не волнуйся.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Nastya, just promise you will not get upset.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Я не волнуюсь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am not getting upset.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Я очень хотел помочь тебе.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I really wanted to help you make peace.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Сломал ему нос.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And I broke his nose.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
