      "t": "Он почти не дрался.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He barely even fought back.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Но он сам предложил.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He was the one who told me to swing.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "И избил человека.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And you beat the man up.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Значит, он сам захотел.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, he asked for it himself.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
